Hilchos Tefillin – Halacha 7 (§1–13)

body { max-width: 750px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.85; color: #2b2b2b; background: #fcfaf5; }

h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #1a3c5e; }

h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 26px; border-bottom: 2px solid #c8a96e; padding-bottom: 12px; }

h2 { font-size: 22px; margin-top: 36px; text-align: center; color: #7a622e; }

h3 { font-size: 19px; margin-top: 32px; color: #8b6914; border-left: 3px solid #c8a96e; padding-left: 10px; }

p { text-indent: 28px; margin: 10px 0; text-align: justify; }

p.no-indent { text-indent: 0; }

.key-term { color: #6b1d1d; font-weight: 600; }

.bold-concept { font-weight: bold; color: #1a3c5e; }

.transliteration { font-style: italic; color: #555; }

.source { font-size: 0.88em; color: #888; }

.bracket-def { font-size: 0.92em; color: #666; }

.zohar-quote { font-style: italic; color: #5a3e1b; }

.translator-summary { margin-top: 60px; border-top: 3px double #c8a96e; padding-top: 30px; }

.translator-summary .ts-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 28px; }

.translator-summary .ts-header h2 { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 22px; color: #7a622e; margin: 0 0 4px 0; letter-spacing: 1px; }

.translator-summary .ts-header .ts-subtitle { font-size: 13px; color: #b89a5a; font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }

.ts-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px; }

@media (max-width: 600px) { .ts-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.ts-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #faf6ed 0%, #f5eed8 100%); border-left: 4px solid; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 16px 18px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(120,90,30,0.08); }

.ts-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(120,90,30,0.14); }

.ts-card .ts-section-num { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }

.ts-card .ts-card-title { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #2b2b2b; margin-bottom: 6px; }

.ts-card .ts-card-body { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: #4a4a4a; }

.ts-card.c1 { border-color: #c8a96e; } .ts-card.c1 .ts-section-num { color: #c8a96e; }

.ts-card.c2 { border-color: #8b6914; } .ts-card.c2 .ts-section-num { color: #8b6914; }

.ts-card.c3 { border-color: #6b1d1d; } .ts-card.c3 .ts-section-num { color: #6b1d1d; }

.ts-card.c4 { border-color: #1a5c3e; } .ts-card.c4 .ts-section-num { color: #1a5c3e; }

.ts-card.c5 { border-color: #3e4e8b; } .ts-card.c5 .ts-section-num { color: #3e4e8b; }

.ts-card.c6 { border-color: #7a4e2e; } .ts-card.c6 .ts-section-num { color: #7a4e2e; }

.ts-insight { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b1a0e 0%, #3e2a14 100%); color: #f5eed8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px 26px; margin: 28px 0; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(40,20,0,0.25); }

.ts-insight .ts-insight-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c8a96e; margin-bottom: 10px; }

.ts-insight .ts-insight-text { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #f5eed8; }

.ts-insight .ts-insight-text em { color: #e8c868; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; }

.parallel-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }

.parallel-left, .parallel-right { flex: 1; max-width: 260px; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }

.parallel-left { background: #f5eed8; border: 2px solid #c8a96e; color: #5a3e1b; }

.parallel-right { background: #2b1a0e; border: 2px solid #8b6914; color: #f5eed8; }

.parallel-eq { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 20px; color: #c8a96e; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

.ts-closing { text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding: 16px; font-style: italic; color: #888; font-size: 13.5px; border-top: 1px solid #e0d8c0; }

Likutay Halachos — Hilchos Tefillin, Halacha 7
